    {
      "id": "flow1-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1510,
      "y": 214,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 98,
      "text": "1. Teacher pastes YouTube URL → Classroom\n2. Classroom → POST /api/quiz/prepare (Node)\n3. Node fetches transcript (ytdl-core) + title\n4. OpenRouter/Qwen generates 5 questions\n5. Every ~15 min: video pauses, TTS speaks Q\n6. Browser STT captures student answer\n7. POST /api/quiz/evaluate → AI grades it\n8. TTS speaks feedback → video resumes",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#4c1d95",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 512
    },

